    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Debola ng'hangi nkīma",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho waacha ū Ehudi, a Baisilaeli bandya hangī ū kwīta ī yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Seeba ūbajinja mu makono ga ng'wa Yabini, ūmò wa batemi ba Bakanaani, wikalo wakwe walī Hazooli; ū ntaale wa mabità gaakwe ga būlūgū walī Sisela, muna Halosheti-hagoyimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabaluhya no a Baisilaeli, ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī; nguno nīyo ū wei walī na magogoteni ga chūūma; a Baisilaeli būnīlīīla ū Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ūyo walī abasugile a Baisilaeli walī Debola, ng'hangi nkīma, nke o ng'wa Lapidoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī amanīīlile kwigasha ha mbeho ya ntī gwa nhende, gwitanagwa go ng'wa Debola. Gwalī ha gatī ya Lama na Beeseli, mū sī ya magūlya ya Efulaimu; a Baisilaeli bang'wenhelaga henaho ī mihayo yabo wabalamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nshīke ng'wenūyo akatūma banhū kūja Kedeeshi kū sī ya lūganda lwa Nafutali, kūng'witana Balaaka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Abinoamu; ūng'wīla, “Ū Seeba Mulungu wa Baisilaeli alīkūlagīla gīkī, ‘Solaga banhū shihūmbī ikūmi kūfuma mu lūganda lwa Nafutali na Zabuloni, ūbatongeele kūja kū lūgūlū lwa Tabooli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūnduta ū Sisela ū ntaale wa mabità ga ng'wa Yabini, hamò na a magogoteni gaakwe na a bashilikale bakwe, nang'wenhe kū mongo gwa Kishoni, nize nantūūle mu makono gaako.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaaka ūhaya, “Ū bebe ūlū wiza hamò naane hū nakūja, alīyo ūlū ūtajile natūjaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Debola ūng'wīla, “Ūlītūngīlīja tūkūja hamò, gwike ū būlūgū ūbo ūjile kwilwisha būtūkwenhela ikūjo ū bebe, nguno ū Seeba akūntūūla ū Sisela mu nkono gwa nkīma.” Na lūūlū ū Debola ūja hamò nū Balaaka būūkashika Kedeeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika ko ūbabilinga bashilikale shihūmbī ikūmi kūfuma mu banhū ba lūganda lwa Zabuloni na lwa ng'wa Nafutali, būnondeela; nū Debola ūnondeela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaaka kūmpyena Sisela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho Hebeeli, ūmò wa Bakeni; ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī wikomanya, ūbīngīla a Bakeni biye, a ba lūganda lwa kaya ya būkwiye o ng'wa Musa; ūūkakoma iheema lyakwe kūīlīīla Kadeeshi, bbihī na ntī ntaale gwa mu Zaananimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūwīlwa ū Sisela gīkī ū Balaaka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Abinoamu walinhaga kū lūgūlū lwa Tabooli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū Sisela ūgakuminga pye a magogoteni gakwe ga chūūma ayo magana kenda, na a bashilikale bakwe a bose, kūfuma Halosheti-hagoyimu kūshisha kū mongo gwa Kishoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūūnū ū Debola ūng'wīla ū Balaaka gīkī, “Būūkaga ūnsange, nguno ī lelo ū Seeba wantūūlaga mu nkono gwako ū Sisela; angū ū Seeba ng'wenekīlī atatongile koi?” Na ng'hana ū Balaaka wika ū kūfuma ū mu lūgūlū lwa Tabooli, banhū shihūmbī ikūmi biika nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba ūlīpyeena kībi no ī libità lya ng'wa Sisela, hamò na a magogteeni gakwe, ūpyenwa no ū kū būtongi wa līlūshū lya ng'wa Balaaka. Ū Sisela wika ū ng'wigogoteni lyakwe, ūpeela nhambo wa magūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Balaaka ūbapeeja a bashilikale benabo na a magogteeni gabo, ūūkashika nabo Halosheti-hagoyimu. A bashilikale ba ng'wa Sisela būshilīla hasī pye gete, būmalwa līlūshū; atasaagile nūūlū ūmò wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sisela kūbūlagwa na Yaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sisela ū ng'weeene ūbiza wapeela nhambo lwa magūlū, ūūkashika kwiheema lya ng'wa Yaeli, nke o ng'wa Hebeeli ūmò wa Bakeni; nguno walīho wimane a ha gatī ya ng'wa Yabini ū ntemi wa Hazooli nū lūganda lwa Hebeeli ū Nkeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yaeli ūfuma kūnsūng'wanha; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Nzūgū baba wingīle mu kaya, nīyo īnjaga ī mbeho.” Na ng'hana wingīla ū ng'wiheema lya nkīma ng'wenūyo, ū mayū ng'wenūyo ūnkumba kachembeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa wahaya, “Naakakolagwa notà, nigunanhage minzī nang'we.” Ū nshīke wicha shisaabo sha mabeelè ūmpumunhīla, ūgagadangīja, hūna ūnkumba ī kachembeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sisela ūhaya, “Īmaga a ha nyango ūyūūlola, ūlū munhū wiza alībūūja gīkī, ‘Alīmo munhū ū mu kaya ng'wenūmu?’ Ng'wīlage, ‘Mm yaya atīīho!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho walaala yūmīta ī tūlo īkī walī wanoga, ū Yaeli ū nke o ng'wa Hebeeli ūsola līīlūmambo lya hiheema na nundo, hūna ūng'wegeela alīkūngīla poole poole aho walī alaalile. Ūshika ūlūtūlīīla ū lūmambo a ha būshū lūūpulung'hanya lūūkalibīla na hasī, ūchīla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza lītabītile wiza ū Balaaka alīnkūūbīja ū Sisela; ū Yaeli aho wamona ūnsūng'wanha. Ūng'wīla, “Nzūgū baba nakoolekeje ū munhū ūyo ūlīnkooba, ng'hana wingīla alīnkūūbīja ū mu kaya; ūūkang'wipuumūkīja ū Sisela asagalalile achiile na lūmambo lwalibīlaga mu būshū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo, ū Seeba ūmpyeena ū ntemi wa Bakanaani ū Yabini; ūbapyenela a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nkono gwa Baisilaeli gongeja kūbiza na nguzu ja kūbūpyena ū būsugibo ng'wa Yabini ū ntemi wa Bakanaani, kūshisha būbūkenaagūla gete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
